        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hn">Hn</ref> 92.3</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 92.3" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="607" ed="#liebermann"/>Qui murdrum fecerit<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="30" target="#Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.30"/> si capiatur, debet reddi<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="31" target="#Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.31"/> iusticie<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="n" target="#Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.n"/> regis — et talis de quo iusticia fieri possit, non<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="32" target="#Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.32"/> uidelicet occisus aut diffactus<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="33" target="#Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.33"/>, nisi fugiat<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="o" target="#Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.o"/> uel<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="34" target="#Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.34"/> repugnet<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="35" target="#Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.35"/> et aliter nequeat retineri —; et hoc intra VII<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="36" target="#Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.36"/> dies<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="p" target="#Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.p"/> a die qua prius inuentum est.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">New row (October 2026): Liebermann’s text transcribed from Gesetze I p. 607 (two independent readings of the page images, differences settled against the page)</note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.n" n="n" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">607</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">wie</hi> 75, 6<hi rend="italic">a</hi>; <hi rend="italic">trotz</hi> 92, 15; 19 <hi rend="italic">nicht etwa der beleidigten Sippe</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">as 75, 6<hi rend="italic">a</hi>; in spite of 92, 15; 19, not, say, to the injured kindred</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Hn_92-3.lnote.oe.o" n="o" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">607</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">Somner vergleicht Schottisches Rechtsbuch</hi> Regiam maiestatem IV 23</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">Somner compares the Scottish law-book Regiam maiestatem IV 23</seg></note>
